## Why This Is Asked
This checks understanding of offline/online reconciliation, cross-zone security, and hardware attestations in a privacy-preserving scoring pipeline.

## Key Concepts
- Offline reconciliation and tamper-evident ledger
- Hardware-backed attestations and nonce-based replay protection
- Per-tenant isolation and data-retention controls

## Code Example
