interface ScoreShare {
  tenant_id: string;
  device_id_hash: string;
  batch_id: string;
  share: string; // base64
  attestation: string; // attestation token
  timestamp: number;
  nonce: string;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you enforce tamper-evident ledger integrity with cryptographic proofs?
- How would you test offline reconciliation tolerance and data-retention compliance?

